---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="账号与同步" desc="登录后，课程进度、复习卡片和显示设置会在你的所有设备之间同步。">
  <div class="page-head">
    <h1>账号与同步</h1>
    <p>不登录也能学，进度存在这个浏览器里。登录后，它会和你的其他设备合并，换手机或电脑都接得上。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="account wrap" id="account">
    <form id="auth-form" hidden>
      <label>邮箱<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="username" required /></label>
      <label>密码<input type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" minlength="8" required /></label>
      <p class="hint">密码至少 8 位。这里只保存学习进度，不需要你的其他信息。</p>
      <div class="row">
        <button class="btn" type="submit" value="sign-in">登录</button>
        <button class="btn ghost" type="submit" value="sign-up">注册新账号</button>
      </div>
    </form>
    <div id="auth-in" hidden>
      <p>已登录：<strong id="auth-email"></strong></p>
      <p class="hint" id="auth-synced"></p>
      <div class="row">
        <button class="btn" type="button" id="auth-sync">立即同步</button>
        <button class="btn ghost" type="button" id="auth-out">退出登录</button>
      </div>
      <p class="hint">退出后，这台设备上的进度仍然保留。</p>
    </div>
    <p class="auth-msg" id="auth-msg" role="alert"></p>
  </div>
  <script>import '../scripts/account.js';</script>
</Base>
